{"seq":1,"slug":"parameter-learning","title":"参数学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/probabilistic-graphical-models/learning-practice/parameter-learning","wordCount":1709,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"参数学习\">参数学习</h1><p>前面所有章节都假设条件概率表和势函数里的数字是天上掉下来的——Pearl 手填的、专家给的。现实里你拿到的往往只是一张 CSV：几千行病历，每行是一组变量取值。结构（图的形状）也许由领域知识画好，但每个因子里具体的数值得从这些数据估出来。参数学习就是「结构已知、从数据填数字」这件事。它在有向图上常有漂亮的闭式解，在有隐变量时要请出 EM，在无向图上则被配分函数搅得格外棘手。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>参数学习的目标是：给定图结构和一份数据集，估计每个局部因子的参数，使模型最好地解释数据。最常用的准则是最大似然估计（MLE）——选一组参数让观测数据的概率最大；当我们对参数有先验信念时，则用贝叶斯估计（最大后验或完整后验）。数据是否完整、模型是有向还是无向，决定了求解的难易，把参数学习劈成几种截然不同的情形。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[结构已知 + 数据集] --&gt; B{数据完整?}&#10;  B --&gt;|完整| C{有向 or 无向?}&#10;  C --&gt;|有向 BN| D[闭式 MLE: 计数比例]&#10;  C --&gt;|无向 MRF| E[需迭代: 梯度含配分函数期望]&#10;  B --&gt;|有隐变量/缺失| F[EM 算法]&#10;  F --&gt; F1[E 步: 推断填补隐变量期望]&#10;  F --&gt; F2[M 步: 像完整数据一样估参]&#10;  F1 --&gt; F2 --&gt; F1\">graph TD\n  A[结构已知 + 数据集] --&gt; B{数据完整?}\n  B --&gt;|完整| C{有向 or 无向?}\n  C --&gt;|有向 BN| D[闭式 MLE: 计数比例]\n  C --&gt;|无向 MRF| E[需迭代: 梯度含配分函数期望]\n  B --&gt;|有隐变量/缺失| F[EM 算法]\n  F --&gt; F1[E 步: 推断填补隐变量期望]\n  F --&gt; F2[M 步: 像完整数据一样估参]\n  F1 --&gt; F2 --&gt; F1</pre><p>下表把四种情形的难度摆清楚：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情形</th>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>数据</th>\n<th>求解方式</th>\n<th>难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最易</td>\n<td>贝叶斯网络</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>闭式计数比例</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>马尔可夫随机场</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>梯度迭代（含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>较难</td>\n<td>贝叶斯网络</td>\n<td>有隐变量</td>\n<td>EM</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最难</td>\n<td>马尔可夫随机场</td>\n<td>有隐变量</td>\n<td>EM + 近似推断</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"有向图-完整数据-数数就够了\">有向图 + 完整数据：数数就够了</h2><p>这是参数学习里最幸运的情形。因为 <a href=\"../directed/bayesian-networks\">贝叶斯网络</a> 的似然函数按因子分解，全局最大似然问题恰好拆成各个条件概率表的独立子问题——每张表互不干扰，可以分别估计。而每张条件概率表的最大似然解，就是简单的频率计数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>P</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∣</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{P}(X_i = x \\mid \\mathrm{Pa}(X_i) = u) = \\frac{N(X_i = x, \\mathrm{Pa}(X_i) = u)}{N(\\mathrm{Pa}(X_i) = u)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Pa</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Pa</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Pa</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>也就是「父节点取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 的样本里，子节点取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 的比例」。这种可分解性直接来自 <a href=\"../foundations/independence-factorization\">独立性与因子分解</a>——因子分解不仅让推断高效，也让学习可分解。唯一的实务陷阱是数据稀疏：某些父配置在数据里从没出现，计数为零会给出 0 概率，过于武断。解决办法是加先验做平滑（如拉普拉斯平滑或狄利克雷先验），这就自然过渡到贝叶斯估计——用伪计数把先验信念注入，避免被有限样本带偏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"隐变量与-em-算法\">隐变量与 EM 算法</h2><p>现实数据常有缺失，或者模型里就含有从不被观测的隐变量（如「疾病亚型」「用户兴趣簇」）。此时似然函数不再可分解，没有闭式解。期望最大化（EM）算法是标准武器，它在两步间反复迭代直到收敛。</p>\n<p>E 步（期望）：用当前参数，对每个样本推断隐变量的后验分布，从而「软填补」缺失值——比如以 70% 概率属于亚型 A、30% 属于 B。这一步本质是一次推断，于是 <a href=\"../undirected-inference/exact-inference\">精确推断</a> 或 <a href=\"../undirected-inference/approximate-inference\">近似推断</a> 的算法在这里被直接复用：隐变量结构简单就用精确，复杂就用近似。M 步（最大化）：把 E 步算出的软填补当成「完整数据」，用上一节的计数比例重新估参数。两步交替，似然单调不降，最终收敛到一个局部最优。EM 的两大注意点：它只保证局部最优，对初值敏感，常需多次随机重启；它每轮内层都要做一次完整推断，所以推断的代价直接决定了学习的代价。隐马尔可夫模型的 Baum-Welch 算法就是 EM 的一个著名特例，详见 <a href=\"applications-tools\">应用与工具</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"无向图-配分函数挡在梯度里\">无向图：配分函数挡在梯度里</h2><p>马尔可夫随机场的参数学习要难得多，根源在 <a href=\"../undirected-inference/markov-random-fields\">马尔可夫随机场</a> 里那个全局配分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span></span></span></span></span>。对对数似然求梯度，会得到一个漂亮但麻烦的形式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mtext>data</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>易算</mtext></munder><mo>−</mo><munder><munder><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mtext>model</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>难算</mtext></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\partial \\log L}{\\partial w_k} = \\underbrace{\\mathbb{E}_{\\text{data}}[f_k]}_{\\text{易算}} - \\underbrace{\\mathbb{E}_{\\text{model}}[f_k]}_{\\text{难算}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2074em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3263em;vertical-align:-1.5763em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.4237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">易算</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.102em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2