 class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.898em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3263em;vertical-align:-1.5763em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.4237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">难算</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.102em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">model</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.898em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>第一项是特征在数据上的经验期望，数一遍即可；第二项是特征在当前模型下的期望，要对所有变量配置求和——它正比于配分函数的导数，本身就是一次完整推断。也就是说，无向图的每一步梯度上升都内嵌一次推断，代价高昂。这逼出两类对策：一是用近似推断（如 MCMC 抽样）估计那个难算的模型期望，对比剃度法（contrastive divergence）就是这条路线，曾是受限玻尔兹曼机的训练主力；二是干脆换一个更易优化的代理目标，如伪似然——用每个变量在给定邻居时的条件概率乘积代替真似然，避开配分函数，牺牲少量准确性换可计算性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"贝叶斯视角与正则化\">贝叶斯视角与正则化</h2><p>无论有向无向，纯最大似然都容易在小数据上过拟合。贝叶斯参数学习给出统一的缓解框架：为参数引入先验，估计后验而非点估计。在有向图上，狄利克雷先验与多项似然共轭，后验仍是狄利克雷，等价于在计数上加伪计数——既平滑了零计数，也表达了「我们事先认为各取值大致均匀」的信念。在无向图的对数线性模型上，对权重加高斯先验等价于 L2 正则，对拉普拉斯先验等价于 L1（稀疏化特征）。先验的强弱由数据量自动调节：数据少时先验主导、稳定可靠，数据多时似然主导、贴近真相。这种「数据越多越让数据说话」的特性，是贝叶斯参数学习相对硬性正则的优雅之处，也为下一关——连结构都要学的 <a href=\"structure-learning\">结构学习</a>——提供了评分基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>参数学习是「结构已知、从数据估因子数值」，准则通常是最大似然或贝叶斯估计。</li>\n<li>有向图 + 完整数据最幸运：似然可分解，每张条件概率表用计数比例闭式解出，根源是因子分解的可分解性。</li>\n<li>有隐变量时用 EM：E 步推断软填补（复用 <a href=\"../undirected-inference/exact-inference\">精确</a>/<a href=\"../undirected-inference/approximate-inference\">近似推断</a>）、M 步当完整数据估参，只保证局部最优。</li>\n<li>无向图难在配分函数：梯度含一个难算的模型期望，对策是对比散度（近似推断）或伪似然（代理目标）。</li>\n<li>贝叶斯视角统一处理过拟合：先验=伪计数=正则，数据越多越让数据主导，并为 <a href=\"structure-learning\">结构学习</a> 提供评分基础。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"参数学习","id":"参数学习"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"有向图 + 完整数据：数数就够了","id":"有向图-完整数据-数数就够了"},{"level":2,"text":"隐变量与 EM 算法","id":"隐变量与-em-算法"},{"level":2,"text":"无向图：配分函数挡在梯度里","id":"无向图-配分函数挡在梯度里"},{"level":2,"text":"贝叶斯视角与正则化","id":"贝叶斯视角与正则化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"近似推断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/probabilistic-graphical-models/undirected-inference/approximate-inference"},"next":{"title":"结构学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/probabilistic-graphical-models/learning-practice/structure-learning"}}